        <mxCell id="c200" value="&lt;b&gt;+&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=0;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D5D8DC;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="198.748" y="627" width="26" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c201" value="&lt;i&gt;Report view, page Ex 16.4, filtered to the 3 years of the window; the matrix and the table sort their rows by process name. Outlined: the total row of the matrix, which shows the exceptions of all processes and no population or rate. The matrix&#x27;s grand-total column, which adds the years, is not drawn. The table of the model answer is by process, not by test. The page&#x27;s text box is not drawn.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#5D6D7E;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacing=2;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="0" y="657" width="860" height="53" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
